// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// #293 characterization-lock: runOrient with manifest=[{id:'a',sealed:true}]
//     and one stale in_progress row 'a' must return result:ok / batch:null
//     (legacy single-node path).  This is ALREADY CORRECT today — this test
